      "text": "Blueprint. Every page is an engineering drawing sheet: zone-marked frame, title block, details, dimensioned charts.\n\nLayout: A bordered sheet with zone numbers and letters; framed 'details'; a title block with sheet n of 8.\nThe memorable thing: The smile chart with dimension callouts measuring the skew: Δ 6.2 vol pts above 20% at strike 80.\nType: Archivo 700–800 for titles and numbers; Archivo Narrow for labels, dimensions, tables and axes.\nLight: bg #F4F8FF, surf #FFFFFF, ink #0A2A66, muted #46608F, acc #1F5FD1, line #7F9DD2\nDark: bg #0A2A66, surf #0D3278, ink #EEF4FF, muted #9DB6E2, acc #FFD54A, line #6F93D0\nMagnet rail on the left edge. Live prices on these boards are NSE closing prices from 25 Sep 2026; every chart is drawn from real data or the project's pricer."
